+Refuel AI Supplements V6.4.59 — installed PWA navigation and AI popup
+
+In the installed phone PWA, swipe left from the Home/Offer of the Month
+screen to Shop, then swipe left from Shop to open the AI Coach popup.
+Swipe right in Shop to return to Home. The AI button opens the same popup.
+
+The AI Coach is a centered, dismissible dialog over the current screen.
+Close it with the X, by tapping outside, or with Escape on a keyboard.
+Its Tools button opens the existing AI action menu. Trust remains available
+from the bottom navigation. The mobile browser remains a regular webpage.
+
+This update preserves the "sale for month" WooCommerce category selection
+and the live product refresh from V6.4.58.
